<urn:atm:triage:finding/QA2-X3-005>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "QA2-X3-005" ;
  triage:title "sc-observability in both [dependencies] and [dev-dependencies] — Cargo may unify fault-injection feature" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/Cargo.toml:18+31 — sc-observability appears in both [dependencies] and [dev-dependencies] with fault-injection feature in dev-dep. Cargo feature unification may activate fault-injection in production build graph. Fix: remove production [dependencies] entry (keep only dev) or restructure. Introduced by X.3." ;
